        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;- solid green: request through the agent (Nova)&#10;- dashed green: in-runtime token minting / optional AVP&#10;- solid blue: MCP gateway -&gt; backend&#10;- dashed blue: Live-backend-data demo path (frontend -&gt; API directly)&#10;- all resources deployed in us-east-1, account 466742534146" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;rounded=1;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
